WeightedECDSAStatelessTest
├── when threshold is zero
│   └── it should return false
├── when guardians and weights length mismatch
│   └── it should return false
├── when signature count is zero
│   └── it should return false
├── when non-last signer is not in sorted order
│   └── it should return false
├── when threshold is met before last signature
│   └── it should return true early
├── when last signer is not in sorted order
│   └── it should return false
├── when last signer has zero weight
│   └── it should return false
├── when non-last signer has zero weight
│   └── it should revert with ZeroWeightSigner
├── when all signers are valid and threshold is met
│   └── it should return true
├── when single signature meets threshold
│   └── it should return true
├── when single signature does not meet threshold
│   └── it should return false
├── when validating signature with data with sender succeeds
│   └── it should return true
└── when validating signature with data with sender fails
    └── it should return false
